{"title":"2018 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1a","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2018 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Sandy’s Fruit Market sells cherries, plums and blueberries. For each type of fruit, the price of one box is shown in the table.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>On Monday, Shane visited Sandy’s Fruit Market. He bought 4 boxes of cherries, 3 boxes of plums, and 2 boxes of blueberries. How much did Shane pay in total?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From the table, we can see that each box of cherries costs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/3/bc3719c11bac960e400f5099762d5e39f6476d92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$2.00$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" />, each box of plums costs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/7/0a7d7975b71234a1a73891e9cb9743311cf33e03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$3.00$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" />, and each box of blueberries costs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/8/548449edef6f356497f86f09cf9560103142d19e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$4.50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Since he bought <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> boxes of cherries, the boxes of cherries cost <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/6/4c696bffece9940db2f5855bfee7d6e1da37d695.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$2.00 \\times 4 = \\$8.00$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"140\" height=\"17\" /> in total.\n</p><p>Since he bought <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> boxes of cherries, the boxes of cherries cost <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/f/d5f3ee2dd8c22384afb58c417cb298ce5fbd48bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$3.00 \\times 3 = \\$9.00$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"140\" height=\"17\" /> in total.\n</p><p>Since he bought <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> boxes of cherries, the boxes of cherries cost <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/e/b7e730952924141f6f47a2df01887ee191cb1a79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$4.50 \\times 2 = \\$9.00$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"140\" height=\"17\" /> in total.\n</p><p>Thus, in total, he paid <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/5/fb52814d08559710d47090b75de6f34fff194789.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$8.00 + \\$9.00 + \\$9.00 = \\boxed{\\$26.00}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"257\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018005246\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.013 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.020 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 46/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 893/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1839/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.225      1 2018_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1\n100.00%   12.225      1 -total\n 43.32%    5.296      1 Template:Image_needed\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36933:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018005246 and revision id 285739. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}